Embark on a linguistic adventure like never before with LinGo Play, the cutting-edge, dynamic, and captivating language learning app that makes mastering a new language a delightful, seamless, and highly effective experience! 

Dive into an extensive range of foreign language learning topics such as Education, Business, Culture, People, Travel, Nature, Animals, Science, Technology, Sports, Tourism, Art, Literature, Music, Food, Appliances, Furniture, Fashion, Beauty, Health, Medicine, and so much more.

70 languages: Arabic, English, Chinese, Czech, Danish, Dutch, English, Finnish, French, German, Greek, Hebrew, Hindi, Hungarian, Indonesian, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese, Romanian, Russian, Slovak, Spanish, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Bulgarian, Malay, Ukrainian, Filipino, Afrikaans, Albanian, Amharic, Armenian, Azerbaijani, Belarusian, Bengal, Bosnian, Burmese, Croatian, Dari, Estonian, Georgian, Kazakh, Kurdish, Lao, Latvian, Lithuanian, Macedonian, Malagasy, Mongolian, Nepali, Pashto, Persian, Sinhala, Slovenian, Somali, Swahili, Tamil, Tigrinya, Urdu, Catalan, Serbian etc.

Discover new languages with LinGo's extensive features:
• 5172 flashcards, 4141 words, 373 phrases for comprehensive learning;
• Over 600 English lessons for all levels;
• 16 engaging and interactive exercises;
• Beginner-friendly English courses;
• Advanced materials for linguists and native speakers;
• Evaluative tests and grading system;
• Solo player mode for self-paced learning;
• Online multiplayer for collaborative and competitive learning;
• Exciting tournaments to showcase your skills;
• Certificate to validate your language proficiency

With LinGo Play, transforming your language skills is a cinch, requiring only 10-15 minutes of daily practice to attain fluency, sharpen language intuition, and hone your listening, speaking, reading, and writing abilities. Our app empowers you to expand your vocabulary, build confidence, and maintain your proficiency in the long run, whether you're at home, traveling, or squeezing in practice during a busy day.

One of LinGo Play's standout features is its focus on practical, real-world vocabulary and authentic language usage, which ensures that you can apply what you've learned to everyday situations. With our app, you'll gain the ability to communicate more effectively, confidently, and naturally in a foreign language, whether you're traveling, working, networking, or simply conversing with friends and acquaintances from diverse linguistic backgrounds.

LinGo Play also lets you play online in duo mode with friends or other players, fostering collaboration, friendly competition, and motivation in your language learning journey. Our app offers a variety of exercises, tests, and challenges, as well as an exciting online tournament feature, allowing you to test your newfound language skills against players worldwide, while also expanding your cultural horizons and developing valuable intercultural communication skills.

Don't delay – download LinGo Play now and embark on your thrilling foreign language learning journey! Our app is available for iOS (compatible with iPad and iPhone), and we provide a wealth of free language-learning resources, including videos, podcasts, articles, and more, to support and enrich your learning experience. Join the vibrant and supportive LinGo community today, and start mastering foreign languages like a pro, while also reaping the numerous cognitive, social, and professional benefits of multilingualism!

For more information about our app and its features, visit www.lingo-play.com and review our terms of service at https://www.lingo-play.com/policy.php. If you have any questions or concerns, feel free to reach out to us at info@lingo-play.com. Our dedicated and passionate team of language learning experts is always eager to help you achieve your language learning objectives and unlock your full linguistic potential!

Creative coloring games for kids will help your child learn more about colors and coloring itself. Let your child become a real artist and develop new talents. Coloring book for kids includes coloring activity which is friendly to the youngest and focuses on different objects that are surrounding kids everyday. Furthermore, these games for kids contain a lot of coloring tools that will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny animations. The following is waiting for you:

- 10 topic packs with 160 coloring pages;
- Easy coloring book for kids;
- Different coloring tools for customizing;
- Creativity development.

Games for girls and boys are designed for children of preschool age and also suitable as games for toddlers of 2- 4 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational games for girls and boys as fine motor skills and logic development. Enjoy!

Тренажёр-викторина по дорожным знакам Российской Федерации. В этом приложении Вы сможете изучать знаки дорожного движения в игровой форме. Наша викторина будет полезна как ученикам автошкол, которые собираются сдавать экзамены на права, так и уже опытным водителям, чтобы освежить в памяти ПДД (Правила дорожного движения).

Чем хорошо приложение «Дорожные знаки: Викторина по ПДД»:

*Два режима игры: Викторина с выбором правильного варианта из нескольких и режим "Верно / Неверно";
*Выбор категорий знаков: можно выбрать необходимые группы дорожных знаков, чтобы тренировать и угадывать только их;
*Два уровня сложности: в тренажёре можно выбрать количество вариантов ответов: 4 или 6. Это поможет усложнить или наоборот облегчить викторину, в зависимости от Ваших потребностей;
*Статистика после каждой игры: тренажёр показывает количество данных ответов и процент верных среди них;
*Набор знаков во всех тестах последней редакции 2024;
*Полный справочник знаков дорожного движения РФ с описаниями знаков;
*Для работы приложения не нужен доступ в Интернет;
*Приложение оптимизировано как под телефоны, так и под планшеты;
*Простой и понятный интерфейс.

Creative and educational game for children that will help your child spend time with an electronic device effectively. Let your child feel like a real artist. The app includes coloring activity which is friendly to the youngest as well as drawing lessons intended to develop fine motor skills. Also, the app contains pictures on different topics which will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny characters. The following is waiting for you:

- 9 topic packs with 135 pages;
- Easy coloring for children;
- Drawing lessons;
- Creativity development.

The app is designed for children of preschool age and also suitable for boys and girls 2- 4 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational elements as developing of fine motor skills and logic. Have fun!

Learning games for toddlers can help your little one learn through engaging sorting and matching activities. These games will immerse your child in the world of Bimi Boo and his friends, who live on an island and engage in various educational activities. Your child will play toddler games featuring various animals, including dogs, kittens, monkeys, birds, rabbits, and squirrels.
This learning game for kids provides an opportunity to spend time effectively and safely on an electronic device. The toddler app features simple games designed to develop fine motor skills, logic, memory, and entertain your child with bright colors, cute characters, and engaging tasks.
The toddler app includes the following educational games:
- Sorting items by color, shape, quantity, and size;
- Classifying objects using logic;
- Matching geometric shapes by silhouette;
- Sorting figures in the correct order;
- Reconstructing pictures from memory.
Designed for preschool kids, namely suitable for both boys and girls aged 2-5 years. All activities are developed with the participation of professionals in the field of children’s education and include educational elements such as puzzles, sorting, and logic games.
Encourage your toddler to explore, learn, and grow with Bimi Boo and friends by enjoying fun games. Let’s embark on this journey together, where all 30 learning games are available to play offline. Get started now and try out 3 toddler games for free!

Are you looking for a fun educational app for your kid to learn the letters of the alphabet? “ABC for Kids” is an all-in-one app for children between 1 and 8 years old that are in kindergarten, in preschool or going to school, and this app will help your kid to learn Romanian basics. This app helps children develop their vocabulary and their perception of objects and beings.

The Kids will learn in an interactive mode about the:
- Alphabet  - learn the alphabet and the letter pronounciation;
- Numbers - identify numbers from 0 to 9;
- Animals: Domestic Animals, Wild Animals, Aquatic Animals, Birds, Insects - discover the world through beatiful images of animals and their specific sounds;
- Colors - see and learn the basic colors;
- Shapes - explore common recognisable shapes;
- Vegetables - teach kids about the vegetables and how they look;
- Fruits - identify fruits and play with them;
- Transportation - see many of the transportation choices that are available to the mankind;
- Musical Instruments - enjoy the sounds of marvellous musical instruments;
- Flowers - learn what nature has to offer us through colourful flowers;
- Professions - understand the basic jobs such as policeman, soldier, medic,etc.;
- Tools - what tools can be used inside a house? 
- Sports - is your kid going to be a big sports enthusiast? See what sport activities she/he might like;
- Sweets - who doesn’t love a sweet, what does your kid like?
- Objects - explore a list of common objects that kids will lear fast.

The images are accompanied by the pronunciation in the Romanian language and other specific sounds. 

The voice sounds (female voice) are professionally recorded in studio.

The App has three sections:

1. Learn - browse through the various educational items or let the app play them automatically for you. Kids can press on the images and the corresponding sounds will play.

2. Test - test your skills per each category
Choose between four images in order to find the correct one.

3. Play - test your skills on multiple categories.
Choose between a mix of 16 categories to find one by one the correct items.

The Free app provides access to :
- the Learning Module - Letters, Numbers, Animals
- the Testing Module - Letters, Numbers
- the Game - first two levels of the game

Information personalized to the children’s need of discovery, together with new tests and games will be added periodically to the list of interactive tools. 

You can use the app on all your devices: iPhone, iPad or iPod touch (minimum iOS 5.0 is needed). 

We are parents ourselves, we don’t like it when we see ads in our kids applications, that is why we avoid placing ads them into our apps. Therefore we invite you to support us by purchasing the full version of this app where you will discover a lot of words and games for your kids to start learning the Romanian basics.

Sound doesn’t work?
Increase the volume and check that your device is not set to Mute . You can find the Mute switch and and the volume buttons on the side of your device.

Thank you for playing our games!

"Learning numbers!" has great potential to revitalise your child's natural curiosity.

This delightful interactive game will help your child discover how to count from one to ten and how to write numbers.

In this educational game, children will follow step-by-step instructions to draw a cute character - a sun, butterfly, snail... And then count them.

When they draw a number, characters magically come to life - butterflies begin to fly and laugh, snails start crawling, and whimsical mice zip back and forth across the screen…

A unique combination of counting with animated drawings makes this app really quite different!
Outstanding voiceovers, funny animations, and comic sound effects will delight your child.

Precisely because of this, your young children will be excited to learn new things such as numbers and how to count them.

This game is great for both boys and girls of a very young age as well as 6 years old.

This fantastic educational drawing game will be a wonderful learning  tool for your preschoolers because it:
- Is an introduction to numbers from 1 to 10;
- teaches elementary counting;
- trains and develops fine motor skills;
- develops imagination and creativity;
- Is an introduction to colors.

Additionally, this children's game:

- Is entertainment for the little ones;
- educational and fun;
- has splendid animations;
- has artful characters;
- assists in developing your child's creativity;
- prepares little hands for writing skills;
- teaches how to write numbers;
- has professional quality sounds and delightful music;
- has cute sound effects;
- great for boys and girls alike;
- is suitable for children 2-5;
- clear and convenient interface;
- it is both an educational game and a children's cartoon
- completed in English;
- unique teaching methods especially designed for very young;
- Ads-free.
- Parental gate
- No access to Internet

By playing this adorable creative game, your child will learn to count and write numbers.
We did everything to spark your child's curiosity! There is no doubt that your little darling will be learning with pleasure and delight!

There is only a part of the content available in the free version of the application. To gain access to the full version, you will need to make a built-in purchase.
